      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0002",
      "order": 2,
      "text": "psychological input, although evidence to support this assumption is slim. Some studies \nsuggest that optimal outcome is achieved by combining psychological and drug thera-\npies,6,39 but negative studies also exist.40,41\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.0,
