    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0003",
      "order": 3,
      "text": "A discussion of the evidence base for psychological interventions is outside the scope \nof these guidelines. It is recognised that for many patients psychological therapies are \nthe appropriate first-line treatment, and indeed this is supported by NICE.6\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.0,
        98.5504150390625,
        422.7699890136719,
        134.27041625976562
      ],
      "text_sha256": "a07251f7987b591150c74a953af6fe20300a09118e3a4d16b08b36afbbe714ff"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0004",
      "order": 4,
      "text": "Summary of NICE guidelines for the treatment of generalised anxiety \ndisorder,6 panic disorder6 and OCD29\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.0,
        149.70541381835938,
        409.0860595703125,
        174.74139404296875
      ],
