    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0005",
      "order": 5,
      "text": "■\n■A ‘stepped care’ approach is recommended to help in choosing the most effective \n",
      "bbox": [
        47.999900817871094,
        180.55047607421875,
        422.7299499511719,
        192.27047729492188
      ],
      "text_sha256": "4b00a03d3860062bd3a4a464888c281075821068e92fdceff9b389c9302e0afd"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0006",
      "order": 6,
      "text": "intervention.\n",
      "bbox": [
        57.0,
        192.55047607421875,
        112.00999450683594,
        204.27047729492188
      ],
      "text_sha256": "c4abe67626af9379ab8f2f5f18c7c80c42e9629a8269ec32545282a8ec754627"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0007",
      "order": 7,
      "text": "■\n■A comprehensive assessment is recommended that considers the degree of distress \n",
      "bbox": [
        47.999900817871094,
        204.55047607421875,
        422.81011962890625,
        216.27047729492188
      ],
      "text_sha256": "0c776fcab6e5e5b9d6bc40bd8905eda74fafb126fe97bea3052b17d5d4fed7a3"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0008",
      "order": 8,
      "text": "and functional impairment; the effect of any co-morbid mental illness, substance mis-\nuse or medical condition; and past response to treatment.\n",
      "bbox": [
        57.0,
        216.55047607421875,
        420.00006103515625,
        240.27047729492188
      ],
      "text_sha256": "93182a5507d2c67565fba8363621cd0c5fe0560baf75435b6834eb36fbe27c1f"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0009",
      "order": 9,
      "text": "■\n■Treat the primary disorder first.\n",
      "bbox": [
        47.999900817871094,
        240.55047607421875,
        194.11000061035156,
        252.27047729492188
      ],
      "text_sha256": "55f22ee4ba0eae803d4fbd3594ded3b282cbb4690a24c92707bacd1f015b9cdf"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0010",
      "order": 10,
      "text": "■\n■Psychological therapy is more effective than pharmacological therapy and should be \n",
      "bbox": [
        47.999900817871094,
        252.55047607421875,
        422.7500915527344,
        264.2704772949219
      ],
      "text_sha256": "e76dcba827986cbcb4c2e6fa70a805de5565a17aa33e4b3f0bbcd1bad6eb7829"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0011",
      "order": 11,
      "text": "used as first line where possible. Details of the types of therapy recommended and \ntheir duration can be found in the NICE guidelines.\n",
      "bbox": [
        57.0,
        264.55047607421875,
        422.7899475097656,
        288.2704772949219
      ],
      "text_sha256": "6c99c8a69052f5e4a6db3533f9cd35aef8f4c012bc2b893ab332ce1bd75e36a9"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0012",
      "order": 12,
      "text": "■\n■Pharmacological therapy is also effective. Most evidence supports the use of the SSRIs \n",
      "bbox": [
        47.999900817871094,
        288.55047607421875,
        422.7799377441406,
        300.2704772949219
      ],
      "text_sha256": "f061389fa894365f7cd5266d6a72b73ae3563cfac96f4686f636fd16c6575f21"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0013",
      "order": 13,
      "text": "(sertraline as first line).\n",
      "bbox": [
        57.0,
        300.55047607421875,
        156.4499969482422,
        312.2704772949219
      ],
      "text_sha256": "7459200a02ed8a8e209860ca9a90e057a5b43e4595b8798864904d32300d7d97"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0014",
      "order": 14,
      "text": "■\n■Provide information on the likely benefits and disadvantages of each mode of \n",
      "bbox": [
        47.999900817871094,
        312.55047607421875,
        422.7599792480469,
        324.2704772949219
      ],
      "text_sha256": "2c3c3bec2290b16e36dc48d95e7c2ce592f363c917f5f92cdb8f513196ad6f7e"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0015",
      "order": 15,
      "text": "treatment.\n",
      "bbox": [
        57.0,
        324.55047607421875,
        101.42000579833984,
        336.2704772949219
      ],
      "text_sha256": "c7ee1e800687c10edbbb02024eb4f31c4b3fa5cf04cca37d3a200a41e1c311f0"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0016",
      "order": 16,
      "text": "■\n■Consider combination therapy for complex anxiety disorders that are refractory to \n",
      "bbox": [
        47.999900817871094,
        336.55047607421875,
        422.7900390625,
        348.2704772949219
      ],
      "text_sha256": "86be3676a3ced0b3aad975fa45cdb5c48c31766862c053b37b76f703519ec4e4"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0017",
      "order": 17,
      "text": "treatment.\n",
      "bbox": [
        57.0,
        348.55047607421875,
        101.42000579833984,
        360.2704772949219
      ],
      "text_sha256": "c7ee1e800687c10edbbb02024eb4f31c4b3fa5cf04cca37d3a200a41e1c311f0"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0018",
      "order": 18,
      "text": "Panic disorder\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.0,
        375.7054748535156,
        120.53400421142578,
        388.740478515625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "9fb67673bcd83733ebfad75559f6870c0671b7c7d318ebb12035380fddd932e2"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0019",
      "order": 19,
      "text": "■\n■Benzodiazepines should not be used.\n",
      "bbox": [
        47.999900817871094,
        394.55047607421875,
        214.2699737548828,
        406.2704772949219
      ],
      "text_sha256": "2cfee5e232026e8334f7a706350d1726030f71ff63deed4c0d370dc3303b590b"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0020",
      "order": 20,
      "text": "■\n■An SSRI should be used as first line. If SSRIs are contraindicated or there is no \n",
      "bbox": [
        47.999900817871094,
        406.55047607421875,
        422.820068359375,
        418.2704772949219
      ],
      "text_sha256": "fe82595c3b67acd180774af39e70da461d359b240db3caa9aa1b7c043bd16e7c"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0021",
      "order": 21,
      "text": "response, imipramine or clomipramine can be used.\n",
      "bbox": [
        57.0,
        418.55047607421875,
        278.8599548339844,
        430.2704772949219
      ],
      "text_sha256": "5bc622d7ceff287242293277d49b35a435af6e9c7ca5ec12c4a14b9b23ecb4eb"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0022",
      "order": 22,
      "text": "■\n■Self-help (based on CBT principles) should be encouraged, as should formal CBT.\n",
      "bbox": [
        47.999900817871094,
        430.55047607421875,
        407.8100280761719,
        442.2704772949219
      ],
      "text_sha256": "5f6d1048bb2d1a36c5bda5ee72076c6054f43af7d142b2d951595f53971d5c06"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0023",
      "order": 23,
      "text": "Generalised anxiety disorder\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.0,
        457.7054748535156,
        196.34597778320312,
        470.740478515625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "8ee770989ce9a706a5c71f142031d482db0c90c36f2380af5672f42f9ee71a8b"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0024",
      "order": 24,
      "text": "■\n■Benzodiazepines should not be used except for crises.\n",
      "bbox": [
        47.999900817871094,
        476.55047607421875,
        286.4900207519531,
        488.2704772949219
      ],
      "text_sha256": "1eb634f7b9a1d27edea78aef7f311e318203da13f6d69541c02c306e11503200"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0025",
      "order": 25,
      "text": "■\n■An SSRI should be used as first-line treatment.\n",
      "bbox": [
        47.999900817871094,
        488.55047607421875,
        257.54998779296875,
        500.2704772949219
      ],
      "text_sha256": "90abf78ccdd41d76d86bc0499af70851d7252953470e0105fce8b3383edd39b2"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0026",
      "order": 26,
      "text": "■\n■SNRIs and pregabalin are second and third choices, respectively.\n",
      "bbox": [
        47.999900817871094,
        500.55047607421875,
        334.0799865722656,
        512.2705078125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "f2dbc17cc2eeef3934cfcbefbf7cd6bc809fcd4efd1b9ebf27b7aa0ea5cd1d0f"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0027",
      "order": 27,
      "text": "■\n■High-intensity psychological intervention and self-help (based on CBT principles) \n",
      "bbox": [
        47.999900817871094,
        512.5504760742188,
        422.8099060058594,
        524.2705078125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "21839c4e3c184ce64c9d4f25869b1bb4676ccff5cb296638ad246a469344673a"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0028",
      "order": 28,
      "text": "should be encouraged.\n",
      "bbox": [
        57.0,
        524.5504760742188,
        153.69998168945312,
        536.2705078125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "7de9f58983acd3d1108edd6c399302594eb9a40c7cd4b58f4f28f7f7bf7029c4"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0029",
      "order": 29,
      "text": "■\n■Antipsychotics should not be offered (presumably this includes quetiapine).\n",
      "bbox": [
        47.999900817871094,
        536.5504760742188,
        381.49993896484375,
        548.2705078125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "6cb2e41579e7abfaf184b22499db6a13101d9e026f862d77f413eeda3ac6d2fb"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0030",
      "order": 30,
      "text": "OCD (where there is moderate or severe functional impairment)\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.0,
        563.7055053710938,
        378.09906005859375,
        576.740478515625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "f58a193ad2e5261ed9cfd2829e0f65b735a0244d64c319801d93a5908c596ef1"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0031",
      "order": 31,
      "text": "■\n■Use an SSRI or intensive CBT.\n",
      "bbox": [
        47.999900817871094,
        582.5504150390625,
        186.44000244140625,
        594.2704467773438
      ],
      "text_sha256": "a5717b73c36713020d8b48673296808dc6e026d232123413dfcee7aea19d654c"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0032",
      "order": 32,
      "text": "■\n■Combine the SSRI and CBT if response to single strategy is suboptimal.\n",
      "bbox": [
        47.999900817871094,
        594.5504150390625,
        365.3500061035156,
        606.2704467773438
      ],
      "text_sha256": "770c824f79049793a813e949d9af3d645a412b2a0f138b46230d375193af51af"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0033",
      "order": 33,
      "text": "■\n■Use clomipramine if SSRIs fail.\n",
      "bbox": [
        47.999900817871094,
