        190.30999755859375,
        618.2704467773438
      ],
      "text_sha256": "05747989da3c37fec65ee4f0325fb6cad29c7ce1fa9d44f6c759fa104761d59b"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0034",
      "order": 34,
      "text": "■\n■If response is still suboptimal, add an antipsychotic or combine clomipramine and \n",
      "bbox": [
        47.999900817871094,
        618.5504150390625,
        422.8000183105469,
        630.2704467773438
      ],
      "text_sha256": "06299a89a2266edd4fe38cb6879fad4928a17e468fa6841ccd6f99672460cd80"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0446-block-0035",
      "order": 35,
      "text": "citalopram (see Boxes 3.4–3.8).\n",
      "bbox": [
